        "TileImage": "$($repository 593a1bbc-7dc5-49d0-975e-994eada3dcda).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome Agent,\r\rthe BCA has received an unusual contract involving a web of infidelity, deception, and personal betrayal.\r\rValentina Yates, a woman of considerable influence and the wife of powerful political figure Don Archibald Yates, has allegedly maintained several affairs with four different men.\r\rWhat initially appeared to be a private domestic scandal has developed into a matter of significant interest to the client.\r\rTake care of it, i&apos;ll leave you to prepare.\r\r-blauball",
